corpus_format: 1
id: length-payload-mismatch
title: Length prefix disagrees with payload length
description: The prefix declares 2 bytes but the input carries more; the input is not exactly one frame.
category: handshake
protocol: 777
provenance: hand-authored
initial_state: HANDSHAKE
final_state: HANDSHAKE

step:
  direction: serverbound
  input: 02 00 00 00
  outcome: rejected
